<SCENARIO VER="105">
<EVENT VALUE="MENUENABLED">
{PLAYSND "escapescape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―The time had gone past midnight.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\病室春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
We were shut up in a room that smelled of disinfectant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\春花子供寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On the bed in the hospital room lay <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> was asleep in a chair in the room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\病室春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s going to be okay, isn't she...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"They said it's not a fatal wound. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Probably, since </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> got between them, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> tried to stop at the last second."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> was not in the room but out in the hallway, and had been the whole time.<PG>
Had I been right to stop <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>'s words had suddenly come to mind at that moment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wasn't this what she had meant about not getting in the way?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking that, my body had moved on its own.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Mm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\春花子供寝る.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Where am I...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, can you hear me? Can you see?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE> slowly nodded.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">what about her...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s fine. She's not hurt."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Thank goodness..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Haruka-chan</STYLE> smiled, though her face still showed the pain.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"What about </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"All right, I'll go get her now! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you call the doctor!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I dashed out of the room and ran to the chair in the hallway where <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> was.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "2000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\女ケ沢病院.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―The hallway lights had already been turned off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A little way from <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>'s room, a figure sat with head bowed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサーうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> sat without shifting, her face bowed down as if her soul had left her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s come to! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　She can see fine, and she can talk!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> didn't move a muscle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What was I... doing...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">All I... wanted was to help </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's over and done with. More importantly, hurry and go to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Ryoji-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... you don't blame me? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I really tried to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> own real daughter, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, I put through something like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Of course... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Of course, I won't say I'm not angry at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But right now, more than that, we should do whatever we can to cheer </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> up. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And for that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you've got to..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"How am I supposed to face her? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> nearly got killed by me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">How am I supposed to face..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"But...! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> wants to see you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Please... leave me alone a little longer... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Right now I'm too scared to show </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> my face... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... if she came to hate me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">then I... I couldn't live anymore..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"All right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Leaving <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> there, I headed for the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s heart was wavering considerably too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only there were something more... something...
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\病室春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\春花包帯バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the room, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE> was sitting on the edge of the bed, answering the doctor's questions.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> was still asleep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"She's fine. There's nothing wrong with her brain or her bones."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I see. Thank you very much."</STYLE><PG>
"Um, are you her father?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Uh, I'm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">My dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> died. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> let a balloon fly away, and he tried to get it and fell out of a tree..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, does it hurt? Are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah! It hurts a little, but I'm okay now! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　All that's left is... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A stiff air hung between me and <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
"Ah, uh, I'll be going, then."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if to escape that atmosphere, the doctor left the room.
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
beside that door stood <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> died?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Oh no...! She heard us!<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Did he die because of me...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> dying was an accident. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it's not your fault―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "10000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
When <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE> had gotten that far, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> ran out of the room.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "10000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I chased after <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dammit! Of course she'd react like that, hearing about <STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro</STYLE> at a time like this!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to tell <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> right away! Tell her it's not <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE> fault!<PG>
Where...? Where did <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> go...!?<PG>
―Where I ended up was the hallway where <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> had been earlier.<PG>
There I found <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\女ケ沢病院.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Beside the panting <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>, as expressionless as ever, was staring blankly at <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>'s face.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"What is it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Uh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Uh...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="2">I'm sorry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> bowed her head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s blank face changed to one of surprise.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"It's because of me that </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ojichan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> died, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So I'm sorry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサーうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"What are you saying... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Saying that now isn't going to save </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I... heard </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ojichan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s voice! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Telling me to help </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> did...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can only be helped if </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Obachan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> gets better too, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, what do you think you can do... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> died, and how much we suffered for it..."</STYLE><PG>
I wanted to say something to <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>, who gave back nothing but cold words.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I felt that would get in the way of <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>'s <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="わびごと">apology</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供怒り.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I'll go to the same school as </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> too! Then I can help </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　And then </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Obachan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can get better too, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Do you mean that? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　What will you do if </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">your dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and mom say no..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> says that'll make her better, then </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Obachan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and Mom too! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I'll stay right by </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s side, always!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Why go that far..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
