<STYLE ID="1">"So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... together..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s waiting for you. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, what do you want to do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Uugh...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　To Motoki-cho... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">to Motoki-cho...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I want to go home... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I want to go home...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Uugh! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I want </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> to smile! I want </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> to be happy!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Heh... you still haven't broken that habit of yours... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
