{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Just kidding. But I'm not only saying this for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s sake. I'm saying it for ours, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I'm proposing the way I can be happiest, so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">so don't just say no right away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Properly, give it your consideration."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
