<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, let's go home to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others, okay?"</STYLE>
