{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Heh... I love you too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Mine and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s, the best daughter in the world!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサーうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"I finally realized. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I'd given up on my own happiness... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> died, and I'd convinced myself I could never be happy again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Even though there are so many people supporting me like this... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I could have grabbed happiness, but I looked away from it."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I won't give up anymore. I won't run away anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Whether I stay unhappy is up to me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">If I can't feel happy, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> will stay unhappy too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">In Motoki-cho, I'm going to find a new happiness with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Because that's what I can give </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... what I can do now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I can't let </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> see me in such a shameful state any longer."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
