{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. For letting me hear </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Haruka's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s voice."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The four of them looked at one another, as if confirming to each other how precious each one's presence was.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物2,人物1,人物3" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I quietly slipped away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For now I shouldn't intrude. I should give the four of them a true reunion.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\七海町病院.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Outside, the hospital lay in the cold air of early April.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there was no wind, and the sky was full of stars, calm and clear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I let out a big breath, the white of it was drawn up into that sky.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\星空.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Coming to Megasawa had been the right choice for us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And bringing <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> along, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE>, it's thanks to <STYLE ID="10">you</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because <STYLE ID="10">you</STYLE> let us hear your voice through <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
that's why we were able to get <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s heart back.<PG>
I couldn't attend the third-year memorial service, but this is the best offering I could give <STYLE ID="10">you</STYLE>, right? [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">You</STYLE> don't have anything to worry about anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Please, rest in peace...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just then, two small figures came out of the hospital.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\七海町病院.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
