{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What's up? </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you shouldn't be walking around too much, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, the two looked at each other and giggled.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"What? What's the matter?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ehe, 'cause we mustn't get in the way of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Get in the way...?"</STYLE><PG>
