<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, you were awake?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm-hm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You were up early today, and with the round trip to Arata and all, you must be tired."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"But as long as </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s by my side, I'm fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, do you remember? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Summer vacation when we were kids. When we were in first grade."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ開始演出\詫言編\詫言編.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"When we were chasing butterflies, I fell down and cried."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I remember. The sunset, and sunflowers taller than us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The two of us chasing two pretty butterflies... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And after that, I put my hand on your scrape."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"About that, it didn't really hurt. I cried because I didn't want </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> to leave me behind."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> were a crybaby, so I know at least what kinds of things make you cry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Oh..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\星空.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"The stars are pretty..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You can see them from the window?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah, I can from here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Hey, that day, the day we chased the butterflies, do you remember how we looked at the starry sky when we said goodbye?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Of course I remember. We made one promise, too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Really? You really remember that too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Let's always stay in Motoki-cho, we said."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"'Cause I went and broke our promise..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But you'll come back again, won't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then that's enough."</STYLE><PG>
