<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! When we go back to Motoki-cho, I want to live near </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s house!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh! Our next-door neighbors moved out the other day! It's empty right now!"</STYLE><PG>
The children, their dreams <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="は">racing</STYLE> ahead to the life to come.<PG>
Are <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> looking at this starry sky too?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There must be memories in this starry sky that someone like me could never understand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And these two little ones will surely carve many memories into the starry sky too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
