<STYLE ID="4">"Okay, time to head back. It'd be bad if you caught a cold."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okaaay!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okaaay!"</STYLE>
